{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54458","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铨大将（京本作「帅」），须要素知（京本作「司」）[兵]（名）（据辛本、川本、京本改。\n）非是等闲虚誉职，莫将军印（京本作「兵柄」）任（辛本、川本作「委」、京本作「付」）狂生，轻拥甲兵行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}